[
  {
    "start": 0.35,
    "end": 2.3375,
    "text": "A heavy brow is not an intelligence"
  },
  {
    "start": 2.3375,
    "end": 3.225,
    "text": "test."
  },
  {
    "start": 3.6750000000000003,
    "end": 5.4,
    "text": "Neanderthals made sophisticated"
  },
  {
    "start": 5.4,
    "end": 7.9750000000000005,
    "text": "stone tools, used fire, and"
  },
  {
    "start": 7.9750000000000005,
    "end": 9.7,
    "text": "survived changing environments"
  },
  {
    "start": 9.7,
    "end": 10.8875,
    "text": "for an enormous stretch of"
  },
  {
    "start": 10.8875,
    "end": 11.825,
    "text": "time."
  },
  {
    "start": 12.3,
    "end": 13.725000000000001,
    "text": "Making a useful tool could"
  },
  {
    "start": 13.725000000000001,
    "end": 15.1125,
    "text": "require choosing the right"
  },
  {
    "start": 15.1125,
    "end": 17.2125,
    "text": "stone, preparing it, shaping"
  },
  {
    "start": 17.2125,
    "end": 19.175,
    "text": "an edge, and sometimes attaching"
  },
  {
    "start": 19.175,
    "end": 20.5,
    "text": "it to a handle."
  },
  {
    "start": 20.5,
    "end": 22.5,
    "text": "Those are learned skills."
  },
  {
    "start": 22.925,
    "end": 24.887500000000003,
    "text": "Their diets also varied."
  },
  {
    "start": 24.887500000000003,
    "end": 26.337500000000002,
    "text": "Evidence from different sites"
  },
  {
    "start": 26.337500000000002,
    "end": 28.150000000000002,
    "text": "includes more than large-animal"
  },
  {
    "start": 28.150000000000002,
    "end": 30.175,
    "text": "hunting: plants and coastal"
  },
  {
    "start": 30.175,
    "end": 32.8,
    "text": "foods complicate the old stereotype."
  },
  {
    "start": 33.425000000000004,
    "end": 35.212500000000006,
    "text": "That does not let us reconstruct"
  },
  {
    "start": 35.212500000000006,
    "end": 37.225,
    "text": "every conversation or rank"
  },
  {
    "start": 37.225,
    "end": 38.5375,
    "text": "their intelligence against"
  },
  {
    "start": 38.5375,
    "end": 41.375,
    "text": "ours. Brain size alone cannot"
  },
  {
    "start": 41.375,
    "end": 42.625,
    "text": "do that either."
  },
  {
    "start": 43.050000000000004,
    "end": 44.825,
    "text": "It does let us reject the idea"
  },
  {
    "start": 44.825,
    "end": 46.9125,
    "text": "that unfamiliar anatomy meant"
  },
  {
    "start": 46.9125,
    "end": 48.2,
    "text": "incompetence."
  },
  {
    "start": 48.65,
    "end": 50.387499999999996,
    "text": "Their final disappearance needs"
  },
  {
    "start": 50.387499999999996,
    "end": 52.925,
    "text": "an explanation involving populations,"
  },
  {
    "start": 52.925,
    "end": 55.324999999999996,
    "text": "environments, and encounters."
  },
  {
    "start": 55.324999999999996,
    "end": 57.3,
    "text": "Calling them stupid simply"
  },
  {
    "start": 57.3,
    "end": 59.099999999999994,
    "text": "replaces that difficult question"
  },
  {
    "start": 59.099999999999994,
    "end": 60.425,
    "text": "with an insult."
  }
]